Full-range fit: Rwp 3.475%, Rp 2.703%, goodness-of-fit 1.217 over 8,301 points. All final CIFs passed the required health check.

The individual WO₃ fractions are semiquantitative because of overlap and texture; their combined 20.63 wt% is more reliable. Detailed SrWO₄ coordinates are inherited from an isovalent scheelite analogue.

